# pgup/pgdown over a long transcript. Fullscreen wires these straight to
# viewport.PageUp/PageDown (internal/tui/app.go), which scroll by exactly
# one viewport height and clamp at top/bottom (charm.land/bubbles/v2's
# viewport.SetYOffset). scroll-long.yaml's content is sized to be more
# than one viewport height but less than two, so one pgup should clamp
# all the way to the top marker and one pgdown back to the bottom one.
@faux testdata/faux/qa/scroll-long.yaml
@size 120x40

WAITFOR /describe a task/ 20
TYPE tell me the whole story
KEY enter
WAITFOR /SCROLL-BOTTOM-MARKER/ 20
SHOT bottom

KEY pgup
SHOT after-pgup
EXPECT /SCROLL-TOP-MARKER/
EXPECT_NOT /panic|goroutine/

KEY pgdown
SHOT after-pgdown
EXPECT /SCROLL-BOTTOM-MARKER/
EXPECT_NOT /panic|goroutine/
